It reads, and changes when the user asks for it, the data of the StorCube
balcony batteries of the user through the StorCube cloud (baterway.com), the
server of the StorCube mobile app, with the e-mail and password of the user's
own app account. That API is neither documented nor official. The endpoints,
fields and frame shapes follow the Home Assistant integration "storcube_Ha"
by jon7119 (https://github.com/jon7119/storcube_Ha, MIT License) and its fork
by xez7082 (https://github.com/xez7082/storcube_Ha); the code was rewritten in
JavaScript, no file is copied.

